1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:05,760
Your photo is not boring. It is flat, and
flat is a light problem.

2
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,144
Shape needs a shadow.

3
00:00:09,694 --> 00:00:13,352
One light, one direction. Something in
front.

4
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:16,389
Nothing else in the room fighting it.

5
00:00:17,359 --> 00:00:21,287
Something far behind, so the depth has
somewhere to go.

6
00:00:22,837 --> 00:00:26,650
Flat light erases shape. Raking light
draws it.

7
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,702
The angle is the whole difference.

8
00:00:31,252 --> 00:00:35,935
Forty five degrees is the angle. Move
until you find it.

9
00:00:36,905 --> 00:00:38,686
It is one step to the side.

10
00:00:40,236 --> 00:00:46,183
Thirty percent foreground. Forty percent
subject. Thirty percent background.

11
00:00:47,733 --> 00:00:51,803
Move the light if you can. Move yourself
if you cannot.

12
00:00:53,353 --> 00:00:56,793
Find the light first. Then find the
subject.
